{{> header}}
  <main class="card main-card practical-app">
    <div class="learn-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">EBIO 4660 • Practical 1</div>
      <h2>Study by observing, identifying, and explaining</h2>
      <p>Use the practical loop: observe diagnostic features → make an identification → explain why it fits. Orders and suborders are no-key recognition; family practice opens a key workflow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs practical-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Practical study modes">
      <button class="tab active" data-practical-tab="learn">Learn</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="practice">Practice</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="groups">Order/Suborder ID</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="families">Family Key Practice</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="anatomy">Anatomy</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="comparisons">Comparisons</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="flashcards">Flashcards</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="speed">Speed Round</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="simulation">Practical Simulation</button>
      <button class="tab" data-practical-tab="reference">Reference</button>
    </div>
    <div id="practicalContent"></div>
  </main>
{{> footer}}
